 for the forward paper test = the top 5 qualifiers that are not versions of each other (one's conditions within the other's, or 70% of the same D trades); the best 5 by score are listed too, qualified or not. Plain 95% per rule (don't be conservative): some rules pass by luck, so the whole search is replayed year by year 2022-2026 - choose the candidates with the picks whose D5 exit was before 1 January, judge their picks (each pick once) on that year: HOLDS when the pooled lift over all picks is above 0 out of sample (95%), WORSE when below, else NOT SHOWN. EVENTS on the candidates' picks and on all picks, each against the D1 open on the same picks: the breakout (a buy-stop 0.05% above the signal-day high, live on D1 and D2), the D2 open after a strong D1 (green, the close in the top 30% of its range), the D1 close after a strong D1. MONEY: Rs 5 L in 2 / 3 / 5 / 7 equal slots, profits reinvested, no MTF and MTF 2x (0.04% a day on the borrowed half), entries from 2022, one position per pick (its earliest entry); the dip arm = the frozen setups' trades in the newest ZONES run, IN or OUT of their picks zone; the same open: the source with the higher net per trade first, then the model's rank.",
